# bound mirrors requirements.in / proxy/requirements.in, which are capped
# <7.0.0 by mem0ai's own protobuf constraint — without this ceiling here too,
# this file drifts to a newer major (7.x) than the other two and we're back
# to a cross-file mismatch, just on the other side.
